+// rekon10 bench calibration (coordinator#117). Stock TBS target leaves current + voltage
+// on generic fallbacks (TARGET_VOLTAGE_DIVIDER 110, CURRENT_OFFSET 0, MILLIVOLT_PER_AMP 20).
+// Measured on this board:
+//   TARGET_VOLTAGE_DIVIDER 158 = 110 * 23.32 V(meter) / 16.2 V(ESC): corrects the ~1.44x under-read.
+//   CURRENT_OFFSET 1600: nulls the ~80 A/ESC phantom. actual_current is in 10mA units, so
+//     80 A/ESC = 8000 internal = (raw*3300/41)/20 at OFFSET 0; null needs OFFSET*100 = 8000*20
+//     => OFFSET = 80 * MILLIVOLT_PER_AMP(20) = 1600. (Was mistakenly 16 -- factor-of-100 unit error.)
+//   MILLIVOLT_PER_AMP 20: still generic, PROVISIONAL -- re-measure scale once the offset clears the baseline.
+#define TARGET_VOLTAGE_DIVIDER 158
+#define CURRENT_OFFSET 1600
+#define MILLIVOLT_PER_AMP 20
 #endif
 
